      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flux → LTX 30s handoff (lab)\n\nWhat this graph does: Flux txt2img still intended as start frame for **ltx-i2v-30s-lab-example** (~30 s I2V).\nModels: flux-2-klein-9b-nvfp4 + qwen_3_8b_fp4mixed (CLIP type flux2) + flux2-vae.\n\nHow to run:\n1. Queue this Flux graph; note the saved still.\n2. Open **ltx-i2v-30s-lab-example**, set LoadImage to that still, Queue.\n3. Watch Save video (MP4). Long run: expect multi-minute generation / high VRAM.\n\nPrompting (Flux): natural-language prose; craft a strong still with clear subject and depth for camera motion.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Flux → LTX handoff — then watch MP4 on I2V"
